    /* Linear is retired (owner + Lighthouse, 2026-09-24): a component is
       linked only when it carries its own SyncView deliverable id. A stored
       Linear URL with no deliverable id reads as ABSENT -- the pill shows the
       honest locked N/A instead of an editable status the gateway refuses
