       DISPLAY ONLY. Callers keep the STORED status in `data-val` and in every
       write path. The owner ruled on 2026-08-19 that N/A is a manual SMM
       choice the system must never write, and the reconcilers park a card
       whose STORED status is N/A, so a write here would change reconciliation
       behaviour too.

       A finished state is never masked: Approved / Scheduled / Posted are the
       states the client is entitled to see, and one must not vanish behind
