        // An undated card has no month, so it must NOT pass a concrete-month
        // filter (otherwise it masquerades under every month at once). It only
        // shows under "All months" (handled above) or the "unscheduled" status
        // filter, which is the reserve pile's home.
        if (!d) return false;
        return d === ym;
    }
    /* Status filter — splits the Sheet tab by whether a post has a date yet.
